  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework 1.x: OCSF 1.9 (1.9.0, the version the schema server reports) is current, OCSF 1.8 is supported, OCSF 1.0 to 1.7 are legacy and upgraded from, and the 1.10.0-dev schema is a tracked preview. It teaches categories, classes and activities, base attributes, the metadata object, profiles, extensions, unmapped data and validation against schema.ocsf.io, with a focus on mapping application audit logs. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines and upgrades, classes and activity IDs, attributes and objects, profiles and extensions, and validation with example events that pass the 1.9.0 validator.",
